# EC-003: Diluting both half-cells tests the activity-ratio approximation
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 ZnSO4 0.001mol
add v1 Zn 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CuSO4 0.001mol
add v2 Cu 0.001mol
cell v1 v2
dilute v1 900mL
dilute v2 900mL
cell v1 v2
inspect
